### Health
GET http://localhost:8000/api/health/

### Register admin: first registered user becomes ADMIN
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login admin
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Create workshop, replace token
POST http://localhost:8000/api/workshops/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "title": "Python Backend Workshop",
  "description": "Introductory backend workshop with Django REST Framework.",
  "starts_at": "2030-04-22T12:00:00Z",
  "duration_minutes": 120,
  "capacity": 20,
  "location": "Online"
}

### List workshops
GET http://localhost:8000/api/workshops/

### Register user
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "username": "user",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login user
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Create booking, replace token and workshop id
POST http://localhost:8000/api/bookings/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token USER_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "workshop_id": 1
}

### My bookings
GET http://localhost:8000/api/bookings/
Authorization: Token USER_TOKEN_HERE
